Author: Mani Brar <mani99brar@gmail.com>
Date:   Sat Sep 19 20:26:01 2026 +0000

    Implement free-form graph explorer for fixture directories

    Replace the Markdown file table with an interactive force-directed
    containment graph of the Pi and Claude fixture folders.

    - API: GET /api/entries returns a flat, deterministic list of directories
      and Markdown files; supports MD_MANAGER_FIXTURE_ROOT; excludes symlinks;
      fails whole listing on source errors without exposing paths.
    - Graph: source/directory/file nodes, containment edges, progressive
      expand/collapse, drag-to-pin, pan/zoom/fit/reset, breadcrumbs,
      URL-persisted folder selection, refresh with stale-state handling.
    - Accessibility: outline view, keyboard navigation in outline order,
      live-region announcements, system light/dark theme, responsive layout.
    - Tests: API tests with temporary roots, model unit tests, Playwright
      suite with fixture mutation tests and a fixtures-clean guard.
    - README documents the endpoint, env var, controls and testing rules.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>

